Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:05.16,Default,,0,0,0,,FLOWRA aapko chaar zaroori PDFs deta hai — Landing Page ke Resources section mein.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:05.16,0:00:10.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Pehla, Presentation — jo FLOWRA ka features overview hai, board meetings ke liye.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:10.25,0:00:14.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Doosra, Deployment Guide — technical team ke liye ki setup kaise karein.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:14.78,0:00:19.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Teesra, Training Booklet — aapke staff aur salesman ke liye step-by-step guide.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.74,0:00:24.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Chautha Customer Questionnaire jab bhi naya customer onboard karna ho
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.08,0:00:25.48,Default,,0,0,0,,yeh form use kariye.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.48,0:00:29.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Aur haan — What's New PDF alag se, jo product updates ka summary hai.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:29.82,0:00:32.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Sabhi PDFs FLOWRA branded hain print-ready hain
Dialogue: 0,0:00:32.78,0:00:35.40,Default,,0,0,0,,aur WhatsApp par easily share ho jaati hain.
